127:T9bf,*Visit us from 23–25 September 2025 in Nuremberg | **Hall 5, Stand 101***

*Waldems, August 2025* – plastship will be present at [FACHPACK 2025](https://www.fachpack.de/en), showcasing practical digital solutions for a functioning plastics circular economy. Together with RIGK, the company will present services and tools in Hall 5, Stand 101, enabling companies to use recyclates in a targeted and quality-assured way.

## Focus: AI-Powered Material Flow Optimisation

The spotlight is on the [**KISS-Projekt**](/benchmark/) (“AI-based Qualification, Control and Optimisation of Material Flows”). plastship offers a modular, data-driven platform to help companies efficiently analyse material flows and use recyclates in high quality.\
From optical and mechanical tests to chemical analyses – KISS combines AI, digital tools, and material data to standardise and improve the use of recycled plastics across Europe.

## Our Solutions for Recyclate Use and Material Flow Optimisation

**- Recyclate Sourcing & Partnerships**\
Access to verified materials through initiatives such as the[Plastics Recycling Taskforce](/recycler-circle/) or the [Recycled Material Benchmark](/benchmark/).\
**- Material Qualification & Benchmarking**\
Transparent, standardised evaluation of recyclates along the supply chain.\
**- Digital Material Flow Optimisation**\
Data-driven analyses and recommendations for more efficient plastics utilisation.\
**- Practical Collaborations**\
Support integrating recyclates into products and packaging in cooperation with [RIGK](https://www.rigk.de/en/).

![](/images/cms/plastship-grafik-youtube-format-fbb95c.webp)

## Meet Our Expert Team On Site

Visitors can receive individual advice and see first-hand how digital tools and AI support the circular economy.

#### [>> Book your appointment & secure a free entry pass \<\<](https://www.rigk.de/en/fachpack-2025)

**FACHPACK 2025**\
🗓 23–25 September 2025\
📍 Hall 5, Stand 101

> Through KISS and our core services, we demonstrate how companies can use recyclates efficiently, transparently, and to high quality standards,

says our **Managing Director Andreas Bastian,**

> we combine data, technology, and practical expertise to strengthen the circular economy in Europe sustainably.

If you have questions or suggestions, please contact me!

**Mirco Gattinger**, Marketing & Social Media Manager\
